### Queue vs Stack

| Queue              | Stack             |
| ------------------ | ----------------- |
| FIFO               | LIFO              |
| First In First Out | Last In First Out |
| add(), remove()    | push(), pop()     |

### One-Line Interview Answer

**Queue is a FIFO (First In First Out) data structure where the first inserted element is removed first.** 🚀













